---
import Prose from '../../Prose.astro';
---

<section class="case-brief site-shell" aria-labelledby="brief-title">
  <p class="kicker">( The brief )</p>
  <h2 id="brief-title" class="case-brief__display">
    <span>Six places<span class="case-brief__break"> a booking</span></span>
    <span class="out">can go quiet.</span>
  </h2>
  <Prose wide>
    <p>
      Outstation cab booking asked people to commit while still guessing. What “round trip” included.
      Which road the fare was for. What the price contained. Whether sightseeing was inside it or added
      on. Whether the car could take the bags. Whether an airport pickup would still be there if the
      flight moved.
    </p>
    <p>Clarity is that list, stated in the interface — before anyone is standing next to a car.</p>
  </Prose>
</section>

<style>
  .case-brief {
    padding-block: clamp(70px, 10vw, 150px) var(--space-6);
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 26px);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .case-brief > * {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .case-brief__display {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.06em;
  }

  .case-brief__break {
    display: inline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .case-brief {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      column-gap: clamp(28px, 6vw, 90px);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .case-brief :global(.prose) {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      max-width: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 719px) {
    .case-brief__display {
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 8.6vw, 2.55rem);
      max-width: 100%;
      gap: 0.2em;
    }

    .case-brief__break {
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
